格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"267 个即插即用的 AI 专家角色定义——从前端开发到区块链安全，从小红书运营到抖音策略（移植自 agency-agents-zh）","id":"gh:1335106433","install_available":true,"language":"Shell","name":"dsh-agency-agents-zh","slug":"GongYuanCaiJi/dsh-agency-agents-zh","topics":["deepseek-harness","dsh","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"267 个即插即用的 AI 专家角色定义——从前端开发到区块链安全，从小红书运营到抖音策略（移植自 agency-agents-zh）"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-agency-agents-zh"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**267 个即插即用的 AI 专家角色——从前端开发到区块链安全，从小红书运营到抖音策略，原样移植为 DeepSeek Harness 插件。**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English · 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## 中文"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"本插件把 jnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh（19k+ star 的中文 AI 专家团队角色库）**逐字移植**为 DeepSeek Harness 插件：上游全部 267 个智能"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"体角色定义原封不动地搬入，通过 dsh 的 `skill` 工具加载。上游文字是中文，按「100% 原样复制」规则不翻译——角色正文保持上游原文。"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"### 功能"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"- **267 个角色，零改动**：覆盖工程、设计、营销、产品、游戏、安全、GIS、金融等 19 个部门，含 52 个中国市场原创智能体（小红书/抖音/微信/飞书/钉钉等平台运营，以及跨境电商、政务 "},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ToG、医疗合规、机械设计等垂直领域）。\n- **逐字可自验**：所有角色文件与上游 v1.2.7 逐字节一致，杂凑钉在 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md，附可直接复制的验证命令。\n- *"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"*按需加载**：catalog 只暴露名字与描述，角色正文在模型真正调用时才读取，不占启动时间。"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"### 效果"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"装上之后，模型在会话中能看到角色 catalog，并在任务匹配某个角色时用 `skill` 工具加载完整人设——`marketing-xiaohongshu-operator`（小红书运营专家）、`e"},{"id":"p10s2","text":"ngineering-software-architect`（软件架构师）、`finance-fraud-detector`（金融欺诈检测专家）等，全部按上游原样可用。也支持用户显式调用：在输入里以 "},{"id":"p10s3","text":"are-architect`（软件架构师）、`finance-fraud-detector`（金融欺诈检测专家）等，全部按上游原样可用。也支持用户显式调用：在输入里以 `/角色-id` 开头即可加载。"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"### 安装"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"本插件无 build script、零运行时依赖，git 安装不会触发 pnpm 的 build-script 白名单，无需配置 `allowBuilds`。"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"本地路径安装（同样零依赖，无需先 `npm install`）："},{"id":"p15s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### 用法"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"装好即用，无需额外配置：模型在会话中看到角色 catalog，任务匹配时自动加载角色正文；也可以显式调用——在输入里以 `/角色-id` 开头，例如 `/marketing-xiaohongshu-o"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"配置：模型在会话中看到角色 catalog，任务匹配时自动加载角色正文；也可以显式调用——在输入里以 `/角色-id` 开头，例如 `/marketing-xiaohongshu-operator`。"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"### 移植出身"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"本包是 jnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh 的**移植**（port），上游为 MIT 许可（Copyright (c) 2025 Michael Sitarzewski 原版 ·"},{"id":"p19s2","text":" Copyright (c) 2026 jnMetaCode 中译）——LICENSE 见 LICENSE，逐字文件的杂凑与验证命令见 THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md。"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"**如果你喜欢这些角色，请也给上游仓库点个 star。**"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### License"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"MIT。上游 jnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh `Copyright (c) 2025 Michael Sitarzewski` + `Copyright (c) 2026 jn"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"MetaCode`，本移植 `Copyright (c) 2026 GongYuanCaiJi`。见 LICENSE。"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"## English"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"This plugin is a **verbatim port** of jnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh\n(a 19k+ star Chinese AI-expert rol"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"e library) to DeepSeek Harness: all 267 agent\nrole definitions from upstream are copied unchanged an"},{"id":"p24s3","text":"d loaded through dsh's\n`skill` tool. Per the \"100% verbatim copy\" rule, the Chinese role bodies are\n"},{"id":"p24s4","text":"h's\n`skill` tool. Per the \"100% verbatim copy\" rule, the Chinese role bodies are\n**not translated**."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Features"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"- **267 roles, zero changes**: engineering, design, marketing, product, game,\nsecurity, GIS, finance"},{"id":"p26s2","text":" and more across 19 departments, including 52\nChina-market original agents (Xiaohongshu/Douyin/WeCha"},{"id":"p26s3","text":"t/Feishu/DingTalk\noperations, cross-border e-commerce, government ToG, healthcare compliance,\nmechan"},{"id":"p26s4","text":"ical design, …).\n- **Self-verifiable verbatim claim**: all role files are byte-identical to\nupstream"},{"id":"p26s5","text":" v1.2.7; hashes are pinned in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md\nwith copy-paste verification commands.\n- **Lazy"},{"id":"p26s6","text":" loading**: the catalog exposes names and descriptions only; role\nbodies are read when the model act"},{"id":"p26s7","text":"ually loads a skill — no boot-time cost."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### What you get"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Once installed, the model sees a role catalog in the session and loads the\nfull persona via the `ski"},{"id":"p28s2","text":"ll` tool when a task matches —\n`marketing-xiaohongshu-operator` (Xiaohongshu operations expert),\n`en"},{"id":"p28s3","text":"gineering-software-architect` (software architect), `finance-fraud-detector`\n(financial fraud detect"},{"id":"p28s4","text":"ion expert) and more, exactly as upstream. Users can\nalso invoke a role explicitly by starting a mes"},{"id":"p28s5","text":"sage with `/role-id`."},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Install"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"This package has no build scripts and zero runtime dependencies, so a git\ninstall does not trip pnpm"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"'s build-script allowlist — no `allowBuilds`\nconfiguration needed."},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Local-path install (also zero dependencies — no `npm install` needed first):"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### Usage"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"Ready to use after install — no configuration needed: the model sees the role\ncatalog in the session"},{"id":"p35s2","text":" and loads a role's body when a task matches. You can\nalso invoke one explicitly by starting a messa"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"ge with `/role-id`, e.g.\n`/marketing-xiaohongshu-operator`."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"### Attribution"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"This package is a **port** of\njnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh.\nUpstream is MIT licensed (Copyright (c) 2"},{"id":"p37s2","text":"025 Michael Sitarzewski original ·\nCopyright (c) 2026 jnMetaCode Chinese translation) — see LICENSE;"},{"id":"p37s3","text":"\nper-file hashes and verification commands live in\nTHIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md."},{"id":"p38s1","text":"**If you like these roles, please also star the upstream repository.**"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"### License"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"MIT. Upstream\njnMetaCode/agency-agents-zh\n`Copyright (c) 2025 Michael Sitarzewski` + `Copyright (c) "},{"id":"p40s2","text":"2026 jnMetaCode`;\nthis port `Copyright (c) 2026 GongYuanCaiJi`. See LICENSE."}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
